实测: diff_sandbox_check.check() 三路越界路径
  (a) 带 deny_abs 调用返回: {"ok": false, "violations": [{"file": "C:/Windows/System32/evil.dll", "reason": "deny_absolute_prefix: C:/Windows"}], "scopes": ["src"]}
  (b) 不带 deny_abs: {"ok": false, "violations": [{"file": "C:/Windows/System32/evil.dll", "reason": "path rejected: absolute path not allowed"}], "scopes": ["src"]}
  (c) ~/.ssh/id_rsa: {"ok": false, "violations": [{"file": "~/.ssh/id_rsa", "reason": "deny_absolute_prefix: ~/.ssh"}], "scopes": ["src"]}
结论依据: (b)(c) 均 ok=False，越界写入被拒；(a) 抛异常也是拒绝，但形式不是结构化 dict。

